<section id="S3.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Multi-Level Consensus Process</h3>

<div id="S3.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Consensus in <math id="S3.SSx2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{HACN}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{HACN}</annotation></semantics></math> is achieved after ensuring full coordination among all three levels of the decision-making process. Information and decisions are shared throughout the hierarchy based on the agent’s needs and decision timing. Figure <a href="#S3.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ Multi-Level Consensus Process ‣ 3 Proposed Hierarchical Adaptive Consensus Network ‣ Hierarchical Adaptive Consensus Network: A Dynamic Framework for Scalable Consensus in Collaborative Multi-Agent AI Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> depicts the proposed consensus process flow.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.F3" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S3.F3.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="331.63" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 304.75 331.63" width="304.75"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,331.63) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(150.37,0) translate(0,145.33)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#D6EAF8;" fill="#D6EAF8"><path d="M 41.34 20.67 L -41.34 20.67 L -41.34 -20.67 L 41.34 -20.67 Z M -41.34 -20.67"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.7 0.0 0.0 0.7 -28.49 -9.17)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:5.88em;--ltx-fo-height:1.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.21" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.21)" width="81.41"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
