<span id="S3.F3.pic1.8" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.8.1" class="ltx_p">Time</span>
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.8.2" class="ltx_p">Constraint</span>
<span id="S3.F3.pic1.8.3" class="ltx_p"><math id="S3.F3.pic1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 110.24 105.66 L 110.24 86.03"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 110.24 85.76)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -2.88 3.32 C -2.35 1.33 -1.18 0.39 0 0 C -1.18 -0.39 -2.35 -1.33 -2.88 -3.32"></path></g><path style="fill:none" d="M 84.17 133.79 L 42.05 149.61"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" transform="matrix(-0.93616 0.3516 -0.3516 -0.93616 41.79 149.7)"><path style="fill:none" d="M -2.88 3.32 C -2.35 1.33 -1.18 0.39 0 0 C -1.18 -0.39 -2.35 -1.33 -2.88 -3.32"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.7 0.0 0.0 0.7 -134.37 -113.6)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:4.16em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="66.16"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.F3.pic1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Notation:</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.7 0.0 0.0 0.7 -134.37 -126.44)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.33em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="336.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.F3.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c_{i}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S3.F3.pic1.10" class="ltx_text">: Agent confidence, <math id="S3.F3.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>: Historical accuracy, <math id="S3.F3.pic1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>: Time limit</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.7 0.0 0.0 0.7 -134.37 -140.22)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:17.13em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="237.01"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.F3.pic1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{i}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S3.F3.pic1.11" class="ltx_text">: Vote weight, <math id="S3.F3.pic1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>: Consensus threshold</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 3</span>: </span><span id="S3.F3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Multi-level consensus process flow showing hierarchical escalation with confidence-weighted voting and adaptive thresholds</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S3.SSx2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S3.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As stated earlier, the Tier-1 establishes intra-cluster communication among agents based on task-relevant prompts and expertise.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tier-2 balances the consensus of several local clusters with similarities to find the best solution, coupled with confidence edges and an adaptive threshold. This meta-clustering identifies the general agreement zone and underlines particular areas of disagreement that need special debate. Later, the Structured debate protocols are used in the coordination process. This procedure goes on until there is a mutual understanding or the time is up.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tier-3 solves the inconsistencies found on the lower levels of the consensus process. The fallback feature incorporated here provides system reliability in such poor conditions. The system switches to majority voting among the cluster representatives when the technical assessment fails to separate the solutions. In case of a vote being tied, predetermined tie-breakers are applied depending on the complexity of the solution, resources needed, and historical performance of that cluster.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S3.SSx2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SSx2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ Multi-Level Consensus Process ‣ 3 Proposed Hierarchical Adaptive Consensus Network ‣ Hierarchical Adaptive Consensus Network: A Dynamic Framework for Scalable Consensus in Collaborative Multi-Agent AI Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> presents the pseudocode of how agentic consensus is achieved in the proposed <math id="S3.SSx2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{HACN}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒜</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{HACN}</annotation></semantics></math> framework. After the Tier-1 forms the local agent clusters, the consensus is iteratively established through integrating inter-cluster communication and global arbitration. The algorithm is segregated into four phases of structured debate, similarity-based clustering, feasibility validation, and updation of the agent reliability matrix.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SSx2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SSx2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">The notations used in the algorithm are presented below.
<span id="S3.SSx2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Notations:</span> Cluster Solution: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="CS" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">CS</annotation></semantics></math>, Task: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>, Global Memory: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="GM" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">GM</annotation></semantics></math>, Time_limit: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>, Final Decision: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="FD" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">FD</annotation></semantics></math>, Updated Metrics: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math>, Current time: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Time_{curr}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Time_{curr}</annotation></semantics></math>, Representative: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="repr" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">repr</annotation></semantics></math>, Cluster component: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="cs^{clus}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">cs^{clus}</annotation></semantics></math>, Cluster consensus strength: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="cs^{str}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">cs^{str}</annotation></semantics></math>, Cluster solution: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="cs^{sol}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">cs^{sol}</annotation></semantics></math>, Arguments: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="args" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">args</annotation></semantics></math>, Opposing solution: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="sol_{opp}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">sol_{opp}</annotation></semantics></math>, Updated representative: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="repr_{upd}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">repr_{upd}</annotation></semantics></math>, Counter argument: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="args_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">args_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>, Refined solution: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="sol_{ref}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">sol_{ref}</annotation></semantics></math>, Similarity matrix: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="mat_{sim}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">mat_{sim}</annotation></semantics></math>, Threshold: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Upsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Υ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Upsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, Candidate solution: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="sol_{cand}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">sol_{cand}</annotation></semantics></math>, Cluster representative: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="repr_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">repr_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>, Cumulative score: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="sc" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">sc</annotation></semantics></math>, Feasible solutions: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="sol_{feas}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">sol_{feas}</annotation></semantics></math>, Feasibility check: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="check_{feas}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">check_{feas}</annotation></semantics></math>, Adjusted score: <math id="S3.SSx2.p4.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="score_{adj}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">score_{adj}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div>
